      "statement": "The SDK exposes orthogonal beta profile registries: ProviderProfile controls string-model construction through init_chat_model, while HarnessProfile controls prompt, tools, middleware, and default-subagent behavior after model construction; both accept provider or provider:model keys and registration layers rather than replaces existing settings.",
